Primary (Logo Brown): #915524
Secondary (Black Arc): #1A1A1A
Accent (Highlight): #D48441
Background (Page): #F9F7F2
Text Primary: #2D2D2D
Link Color: #A6632D

Heading Font: Cinzel
Heading Weight: Bold (700)
Best for: Page titles, H1, H2, and site branding.

Body Font: Montserrat
Body Weight: Regular (400) or Light (300)
Best for: Paragraphs, menu items, and button text.


Base Settings (The Foundation)
Base Font Size: 16px (This equals 1rem in CSS). This is the standard web default for optimal reading.

Base Line Height: 1.6 (Provides comfortable breathing room between lines of text).

Background Color: #F9F7F2 (Soft Alabaster).

H1: Main Page Titles
Purpose: The biggest headline on the page (e.g., "Welcome to Brahmagupta Mathematics Club").

Font Family: Cinzel (Serif)

Font Size: 2.5rem (40px)

Font Weight: Bold (700)

Color: #915524 (Primary Copper)

Styling Note: Cinzel is naturally capitalized, giving it a very grand, monumental feel perfect for a main header.

H2: Section Headings
Purpose: Titles for major sections (e.g., "About the Club", "Upcoming Events", "Our Members").

Font Family: Cinzel (Serif)

Font Size: 2rem (32px)

Font Weight: Bold (700)

Color: #1A1A1A (Secondary Onyx)

Styling Note: Using the darker Onyx color here instead of Copper prevents the page from looking too "orange" and establishes a solid visual anchor as users scroll.

H3: Sub-section Titles & Cards
Purpose: Titles inside smaller containers, like individual event names, blog post titles, or feature cards.

Font Family: Montserrat (Sans-Serif)

Font Size: 1.5rem (24px)

Font Weight: Semi-Bold (600)

Color: #915524 (Primary Copper)

Styling Note: We switch to Montserrat here because Cinzel can become hard to read at smaller sizes. Making it Copper helps it stand out as a clear sub-heading.

Body / p: Main Paragraph Text
Purpose: All standard reading material and descriptions.

Font Family: Montserrat (Sans-Serif)

Font Size: 1rem (16px)

Font Weight: Regular (400)

Color: #2D2D2D (Text Primary - Charcoal)

Styling Note: Never use pure black (#000000) for body text as it causes eye strain against light backgrounds. The Charcoal Gray is softer and much more readable.

a: Hyperlinks
Purpose: Any clickable text link within a paragraph.

Font Family: Inherits from Body (Montserrat)

Font Size: 1rem (16px)

Font Weight: Semi-Bold (600)

Color: #A6632D (Link Bronze)

Hover State: Change color to #D48441 (Accent Ochre) and add an underline when the mouse hovers over it.

button: Call to Action (CTAs)
Purpose: Clickable buttons (e.g., "Join Now", "Read More", "Submit").

Font Family: Montserrat (Sans-Serif)

Font Size: 1rem (16px) or 1.125rem (18px)

Font Weight: Semi-Bold (600) or Bold (700)

Text Transformation: Uppercase (e.g., "JOIN THE CLUB") with a slight letter-spacing (1px) to make it look crisp.

Color: White text (#FFFFFF) on a #915524 (Primary Copper) background.

small / footer: Fine Print
Purpose: Copyright info, footer links, image captions.

Font Family: Montserrat (Sans-Serif)

Font Size: 0.875rem (14px)

Font Weight: Light (300) or Regular (400)

Color: #E0E0E0 (Light Gray) if placed on the dark Onyx footer, or #2D2D2D if on the light background.